  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Informationssystem, IMG</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infosystem MIER/DACU-IMG - Informationsystem, IMG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fortsatt utveckling och f&#xF6;rst&#xE4;rkning av anv&#xE4;ndande och utveckling av en databas r&#xF6;rande utl&#xE4;ndskt st&#xF6;d. Databasen handhas av koordineringsministeriet i Serbien och ska bidra till en b&#xE4;ttre planering av framtida insatser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to consolidate the achievements of the establishment of a foreign assistance database with the Ministry of International and Economic Relations. The database is to strengthen the Governments capacities in order that it may better coordinate, plan and interface with counterparts on activities of reconstruction, reform and restructuring leading to sustainable economic development.</narrative>
  </description>
